			<div class="glow-block feature-block"><div class="section-header feature-header"><div><h2>Tips</h2><p>Kaido rewards careful ramp planning, disciplined DON!! management, and patience once the late game begins.</p></div></div><ol class="tips-list">{tips.map((tip) => <li class="tip-item"><div class="tip-card-list">{tip.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card tip-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} data-code={entry.effectCode}><img src={entry.img} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy" /></button>)}</div><p class="curve-note">{tip.text}</p></li>)}</ol></div>
